hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"469","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab sawari ka janwar girwi rakha jae to us par kharch ki wajah se sawari ki ja sakti hai. Aur doodh wale janwar ka doodh piya ja sakta hai. Aur jo sawari kare ya us ka doodh piye to us ka kharch us ke zimme hoga.'"
"470","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Girwi janwar par us ki dekhbhal ke badle sawari ki ja sakti hai, aur doodh wala janwar jab girwi ho to us ke doodh ko us ki dekhbhal ke badle piya ja sakta hai. Aur jo sawari kare ya us ka doodh piye to us ki dekhbhal us ke zimme hai.'"
"471","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Girwi janwar par sawari ki ja sakti hai aur us ka doodh piya ja sakta hai."
